      "trackName": "Maze Game",
      "description": "Maze Game: Ultimate Maze Survival. Guide the Red Ball to the goal! Can you survive the ticking clock and the relentless pursuer?\nExperience a unique, randomly generated labyrinth every time you play!\n\n【Game Features】\n - 9 Challenging Levels: Master 3 patterns per level to advance.\n - Dynamic Maze Sizes: The labyrinth grows in 3 stages as you level up.\n - Time Reset: Grab the \"White Ball\" to reset the timer.\n - 3 Lives System: Running out of time or being caught by the Blue Ball costs a life. Lose all 3, and it's Game Over!\n\nSpeed, strategy, and survival. Protect your lives and conquer the labyrinth today!",
